[Follow-up record and approval note] {case_id}
{date} {time} follow-up: A chain fitness store (3 branches: Chengdong, Chengxi, and Gaoxin) has been closed since {date}; prepaid cards cannot be used and fees cannot be refunded. As of {time}, 217 consumers have been registered, involving a total unconsumed amount of 86.4 ten-thousand yuan, with the highest per household at 1.2 ten-thousand yuan; among them, 62 at the Chengdong store, 78 at the Chengxi store, and 77 at the Gaoxin store. The three stores belong to 3 districts, and the requester has separately reported the matter on the hotline platforms of 5 districts across the city. The local authorities have interviewed the operator twice without result.
Approval note: Given the relatively large number of people and amount involved and the cross-district distribution, approval is given to request supervision, with coordinated handling at the municipal level. Other: The business license change progress inquiry made by a manufacturing enterprise equipment engineer on {date} is unrelated to this case and has been answered separately.
